{"The ability composition in AlertRuleMenu (combining ruler and Grafana abilities for Pause/Delete/Duplicate/Silence/Export) is very repetitive; consider extracting a small helper that merges two Ability tuples into a single canX flag to reduce duplication and make future changes less error-prone": 0.0334685780107975, "In RuleActionsButtons.V2, returning null when getEditableIdentifier fails will silently hide all actions for that rule; if this can happen in non-error scenarios (e.g., non-Grafana, non-ruler rules), it may be worth tightening the type constraints or adding an explicit guard so that only genuinely unsupported cases hit this path": 0.0985642820596695}